<title>UK: Metals end mixed, LME movements unpredictable.</title>
<headline>Metals end mixed, LME movements unpredictable.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends lower after whippy volatile trading.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Mirrors copper and thrashes around to close softer.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Closes steadier, supported around $8,000.</p>
<p>ZINC - Ends firm, near 4-1/2 year peak.</p>
<p>LEAD - Finishes strong.</p>
<p>TIN - Concludes steadier above $6,000. ALLOY - Quiet.</p>
</text>
